# Front-end configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` (which is gitignored) and edit. Everything here is
# OPTIONAL — with no file at all the UI talks to a backend on localhost:3009,
# which is what `bun run webhook` serves.

# Origin of the API server. ORIGIN ONLY: no `/api` suffix, no trailing slash —
# the client adds the `/api` prefix itself.
#
# Read at BUILD time, not at run time: Next inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables into
# the bundle, so changing this means rebuilding, and a container cannot be
# re-pointed by editing its environment.
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://awa-api.example.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3009
